4. Wrapped the component with all necessary providers that were present in the stack trace
5. Added Suspense boundary to handle the lazy loading
6. Added error handling for the dynamic import
7. Created a QueryClient instance for the QueryClientProvider

The changes should resolve the "Failed to fetch dynamically imported module" error by:
